# Keep the build context to sources. Two reasons this matters:
#  - updater/packaging.key is the conventional key location and sits INSIDE the
#    context; excluding it keeps the secret out of the daemon and its cache.
#  - build/ holds ~70 MB of finished .UPD images and binaries that would
#    otherwise be uploaded on every rebuild, and deck/out/ could shadow the
#    container's own build products.
build/
deck/out/
updater/test/
*.key
*.UPD
*.crc32
*.iso
.DS_Store

deck/out*/
